  "title": "Burford CEO writes for The Times about the UK Supreme Court PACCAR ruling",
  "summary": "Burford CEO Christopher Bogart has written an op-ed in The Times about how the 2023 UK Supreme Court ruling in the case of PACCAR has made it harder for cases to be funded and flies in the face of government policy intent. He joins leading law firms and legal experts in calling on the Government to act to correct this issue. Learn more.",
